  "note": "In the book (5.32) only feeds (5.36). Erratum: Both cases fail with G_v the exact sum (5.28), the least function the text allows: for v = 1, ∫₁⁵ G₁(S)dS/S = (2/3)log 2 + (1/3)log 5 − 2/5 ≈ 0.59858 > 0.3698 log 5, and for v = 2, ∫₁⁴ G₂(S)dS/S = (7/6)log 2 + (1/6)log 3 − 11/24 ≈ 0.53344 > 0.37273 log 4 (proved by `Companion.Book.eq_5_32_each_case_false` in `lean/Companion/Book/Eq_5_32.lean`)."
